Provenance note:
  Prices are aggregated from the OpenRouter model catalog and vendor public
  pricing pages; quality indexes originate from Artificial Analysis. Those
  upstream sources retain their own terms. This dataset is provided as-is,
  without warranty; confirm final pricing and rate limits in the vendor
  console before making purchasing decisions.

